<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial Group said analyst Scott Randall raised his earnings estimate for fiscal 1997 to $8.75 a share from $7.92 a share.</p>
<p>-- estimate for fiscal 1998 was raised to $10.60 from $10.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- said the ratings remained unchanged at short-term, long-term buy.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
